# Cursor model selection

Keep small edits in the current turn. For delegated work, use the first available exact Task model slug from the appropriate chain. Frontmatter supplies the named agent’s default. The phase chain controls a per-launch override. Check the actual model on the task card. When a launch fails for access or credit, try the next available entry once. If none can launch, handle the phase in the parent and record the actual model. Keep planning and complex final review read-only.

