## Hard implementation

Use this phase for financial or project records, permissions, concurrency, tenant isolation, migrations, or public contracts. Raise effort on the same model when it skips files or checks. Use Opus 5.5 for hard implementation only after Sonnet at higher effort had the evidence and was still wrong. Keep a complex architecture or final-review call separate from routine implementation.

