## UX exploration and replay

For exploration and judgment-based sign-off, use `claude-sonnet-5-5-medium` or `gpt-5.6-sol-medium` with rendered evidence. For objective replays and narrow extraction, use `claude-haiku-5-5-medium` or `gpt-5.6-luna-medium`. If neither is offered, use the least expensive available Sonnet at Low or Medium. Follow the shared UX workflow linked from AGENTS.md.

## Cursor-only plans and model trials

Use `composer-2.5-fast` for settled implementation when available, then `cursor-grok-4.5-high-fast`. For planning, hard implementation, and complex review, use `cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh` then `cursor-grok-4.5-high-fast`. Trial Grok 4.7 on a completed complex task when the session exposes its exact Task slug. Compare with 4.6 before promoting it. Use the existing GPT-5.6 routes until newer Task slugs are available and verified.

Fable 5.2 is a rare escalation for a long-running problem that remains unresolved after Opus Extra High. Use the current session’s supported model and effort.
